GAL16V8
TEST16V8

A   B   C   D   E   F   G   H   NC  GND
NC  AND NAN OR  NOR XOR MUX INV MAJ VCC

AND   = A * B
/NAN  = A * B
OR    = A + B
/NOR  = A + B
XOR   = A * /B + /A * B
MUX   = E * /G + F * G
INV   = /H
MAJ   = A * B + A * C + B * C

DESCRIPTION
TOP2049 / toprammer GAL16V8 test design (combinational).
Pin 12 AND = A*B, 13 NAND, 14 OR = A+B, 15 NOR, 16 XOR = A^B,
17 MUX = G ? F : E, 18 INV = /H, 19 MAJ = majority(A,B,C).
Inputs: A..H = pins 1..8.
